  "description": "Bring sunshine, freshness, and charming summer elegance to your creative projects with this beautiful Watercolor Lemon Clipart Bundle 🍋✨\nThis carefully curated collection includes 20 watercolor lemon illustrations inspired by Mediterranean summers, citrus orchards, homemade desserts, farmhouse kitchens, and cozy cottagecore aesthetics.\nFeaturing lemons, lemon branches, lemonade, botanical florals, desserts, kitchenware, and sweet citrus-inspired elements, this bundle is perfect for creators looking for fresh, versatile, and timeless summer graphics.\n✨ What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 20 SVG files\n🍋 Featured designs include: Whole lemons, Lemon slices & wedges, Lemon branches & blossoms, Lemon tree, Lemon teacups & teapots, Lemon pie, tart, cupcakes, desserts, etc.\n🎨 Perfect for:\n– Sticker sheets\n– Printable wall art\n– Digital planners\n– Scrapbooking\n– Journaling\n– Kitchen decor\n– Recipe cards\n– Invitations\n– Packaging design\n– Branding projects\n– Canva templates\n– Print-on-demand products\nCreate refreshing, feminine, and timeless designs with these cozy watercolor lemon PNG illustrations – perfect for summer collections, kitchen products, farmhouse decor, and citrus-inspired creative businesses 🍋🌿☀️",
